cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accepted article when using this implementation."
type: software
title: "PS-HMM-IDM: Product-State Hidden Markov Model with Intelligent Driver Model"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of PS-HMM-IDM, a Bayesian product-state hidden
  Markov model for within-driver heterogeneity in car-following. Each
  response regime is an Intelligent Driver Model (IDM) response surface with
  residual dispersion, each traffic scenario is a distribution of observed
  speed, net gap, and relative speed, and a joint Markov process links the
  paired states. Inference uses MCMC with exact forward-filtering
  backward-sampling. The repository reproduces the five model configurations
  of the paper on the highD dataset and provides a CSV interface for fitting
  other car-following episodes.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Chengyuan-Zhang/PS-HMM-IDM"
